uce, cherry tomatoes, olives, onion, pomegranate and mint, dusted with za’atar and sumac, finished with sesame oil and crisp lavash.","category":"Fresh Salads","price":550,"imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fgreek-hummus-cutout.webp?alt=media","photoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fgreek-hummus.webp?alt=media","ogImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fgreek-hummus-og.jpg?alt=media","available":true,"diet":"veg","allergens":["sesame","gluten"],"nutrition":null,"ingredients":["Hummus","Cucumber","Lettuce","Cherry tomatoes","Olives","Onion","Pomegranate","Mint","Za’atar","Sumac","Lavash","Sesame oil"]},{"id":"potato-apple","slug":"roasted-potato-apple-salad","name":"Roasted Potato & Apple Salad","description":"Herb-roasted potatoes, crisp apples, lettuce, cherry tomatoes and walnuts folded in a tangy French egg gribiche sauce with capers and gherkins.","category":"Fresh Salads","price":370,"imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple-cutout.webp?alt=media","photoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple.webp?alt=media","ogImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/leafli-243ae.firebasestorage.app/o/menu%2Fpotato-apple-og.jpg?alt=media","available":true,"diet":"egg","allergens":["egg","tree nuts (walnut)","milk","mustard"],"nutrition":{"protein":8,"calories":270},"ingredients":["Roasted potatoes","Apples","Lettuce","Cherry tomatoes","Walnuts","French egg gribiche sauce","Capers","Gherkins","Herbs"]},{"id":"potato-apple-eggless","slug":"roasted-potato-apple-salad-eggless","name":"Roasted Potato & Apple Salad (Eggless)","description":"Herb-roasted potatoes, crisp apples, lettuce, cherry tomatoes and walnuts with a tangy eggless gribiche made on creamy hung c